    "PrimaryCharacteristics": "Craters with rims and surrounding blankets; some include single to multi-lobed blanket forms, dense secondary crater chains, and (or) central peak or pit. Blanket thicknesses of meters to a few hundred meters. (lat 23.17\u00b0 N., long 207.77\u00b0 E.",
